; 5_fm_example_f — Castlevania-style dramatic minor theme (D minor)
;
; Slower than typical arcade-FM, sustained notes with quarter-rest
; for tension.  Boss-fight feel.

T220
I5
V12
O4
L16

; A — sustained intro
D4 F A  > D4 < A F
D4 F A  > D2
< E4 G B-  > E4 < B- G
E4 G B-  > E2

; B — main theme
> A4 G4  F4 E4
D4 < A4  F4 D2
> A4 G4  F4 E4
> D2 R4 R4

; C — finale
L4
> A G F E  D < A F D
< F A > C E  D2

~
